# Hand-Written Code Style + Mandatory Self-Review

Match human-authored reference code. When AI-era code conflicts with these references, **follow the references**.

## Canonical references (read before inventing structure)

| Area | Paths |
|------|--------|
| Sessions | `backend/utils/session.ts` |
| Affiliates | `backend/utils/affiliateCode.ts`, `types/AffiliateCode.ts` |
| Admin | `backend/utils/admin/user.ts`, `backend/routes/admin/users.ts` |
| Offers | `backend/utils/offers/fetch.ts`, `backend/utils/offers/ingest.ts`, `backend/routes/offers/index.ts`, `types/Offer/InternalOffer.ts`, `src/app/_components/OfferItem/**` |
| Landing | `src/app/_components/LandingPage/**` |
| Tasks | `src/app/[locale]/(NavigationBarPages)/tasks/page.tsx`, `page.client.tsx`, `page.module.scss`, `src/app/_hooks/useBrowseOffers.ts` |

Also obey: Bun, SCSS nesting, `~icons/...jsx`, i18n guidelines.

---

## 1. Formatting voice (everywhere)

- Spaces inside array literals and destructuring: `[ activities, setActivities ]`, `[ 'asc', 'desc' ]`, `[ ...list, value ]`, deps `[ socket, t ]`.
- Prefer single-arg arrows without parens when simple: `page => page`, `item => item !== value`.
- Blank line before `return` after non-trivial logic (see `session.ts`, `affiliateCode.ts`).
- Early returns over deep nesting: `if (!session) return { ok: false, error: 'notFound' };`.
- Magic numbers become named constants with a short comment when non-obvious:

```ts
const CACHE_TTL_SECONDS = 900; // 15 minutes
const expiryDate = new Date(issueDate.getTime() + 604800000); // 1 Week
```

- Do **not** add `useMemo` / `useCallback` by default.
- Do **not** build objects with conditional spreads (`...(cond && { key })`, `...(cond && { nested })`). Assign optional fields after the base object with plain `if` statements instead:

```ts
// ❌ BAD — hard to skim
const doc = {
  id,
  ...(heldUntil && { heldUntil }),
  ...(clickID && { clickID }),
  ...((eventID || eventName) && { event: { eventID: eventID ?? '', eventName: eventName ?? '' } }),
};

// ✅ GOOD
const doc = { id };
if (heldUntil) doc.heldUntil = heldUntil;
if (clickID) doc.clickID = clickID;
if (eventID || eventName) {
  doc.event = {
    eventID: eventID ?? '',
    eventName: eventName ?? '',
  };
}
```

