## 7. SCSS modules

- `@use '@styles/variables.scss' as *;`
- **One root class**; nest all locals under it with `>` (see SCSS nesting rule). Nest must mirror JSX.
- Tokens: `$text-bold`, `$text-light`, `$border-light`, `$primary`, `$background`, `$content-max-width`, `$off-white`, breakpoint vars.
- Reset heading/paragraph margin in place (`margin: 0`) when setting type styles (tasks header).
- Local SCSS vars at top of file above the root class.
- Landing sections commonly: `padding: 96px 0`, `max-width: $content-max-width`, title `gap: 12px`, section `gap: 40px`.

---

## 8. i18n

- No new user-facing hardcoded strings in UI (option labels are keys, not English copy).
- Landing highlight spans via `t.rich`; tasks/control copy under page namespaces (`TasksPage`, `TasksMetadata`).
- Update `en.json` first, then every locale (i18n rule).

